RESEARCH ARTIFACT DISCLAIMER

The formal verification artifacts (*.lean files) are provided as frozen
mathematical specimens for research purposes. They represent a specific
experimental configuration for mutation testing and should not be interpreted
as production verification tools or general-purpose libraries.

The verification claims herein are relative to:
- Lean 4.10.0 kernel (commit c375e19f6b65)
- No external dependencies beyond Lean core
- Specific axiom assumptions (propext, Quot.sound)

Users should independently verify any claims before relying on them for
critical applications.
